<title>MALAYSIA: MAA says 1-for-10 bonus issue approved.</title>
<headline>MAA says 1-for-10 bonus issue approved.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysian Assurance Alliance Bhd (MAA) said on Tuesday that the Securities Commission has approved a proposed 1-for-10 bonus issue, instead of a 1-for-5 issue.</p>
<p>In a statement issued by its merchant bankers, MAA said the Director-General of Insurance had in November also approved the bonus issue of up to 10.06 million new shares.</p>
<p>The planned bonus is subject to further approvals from MAA shareholders and the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange.</p>
</text>
